  "steps": [
    "Char the bell pepper till fully black — the smokiness is elite.",
    "Heat 2 tsp olive oil and add garlic + walnuts.",
    "Add onions, cook for 2 mins, then add tomatoes + cherry tomatoes + salt + pepper and let everything get mushy.",
    "Boil the pasta till al dente and save that pasta water — non-negotiable.",
    "Blend the tomato–onion base + charred bell pepper + 120g paneer + pasta water till smooth and creamy.",
    "In a hot pan, cook mushrooms without oil for 4–5 mins till they smell insane.",
    "Add the sauce, add the pasta, sprinkle chili flakes + oregano, and let it cook for 5–6 mins.",
    "Finish with basil and optional chili oil for that final glow-up."
  ],
